  "question": {
    "text": "A pendulum is oscillating with an angular amplitude of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math> as shown in the figure. The value of angle&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math>, made by the string with the vertical, at which the acceleration is directed horizontally is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/132398_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 162px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
