  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For horizontal acceleration, net force in vertical direction should be zero.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/1354_mvb.PNG\" style=\"width: 162px; height: 158px;\" /><br /><br />Loss in potential energy = gain in kinetic energy<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> The net force towards O is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br />Or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
